---
import { deliverables } from '../data/meta';
---

<section id="output">
  <div class="section-head">
    <div class="kicker">交付</div>
    <h2>八周后你手上应该有这些</h2>
    <p>计划的价值不在于「学完了」，而在于留下能拿出来给面试官看的东西。</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card pad">
    <ul class="clean">{deliverables.map((d) => <li set:html={d} />)}</ul>
  </div>
</section>
